                                                "sense_id": "fa47ba1a-be54-38f0-b14c-6cd0ccee08da",
                                                "text": "You'll have to get a medical before you apply for that job."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0aa5327d-1ef9-41fc-be0c-0629259a992b",
                                                "sense_id": "fa47ba1a-be54-38f0-b14c-6cd0ccee08da",
                                                "text": "After completing a medical and the requisite paperwork on Tuesday to seal the deal, Di María said: “I am absolutely delighted to be joining Manchester United. I have thoroughly enjoyed my time in Spain and there were a lot of clubs interested in me, but United is the only club that I would have left Real Madrid for."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7032e317-16bb-4787-b5cb-83b9a411f646",
                                                "sense_id": "fa47ba1a-be54-38f0-b14c-6cd0ccee08da",
                                                "text": "All UK train drivers must undergo a medical every three years up to the age of 54, and annually from then on."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
